00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:41.190
So at this point, you would
deploy it on an integration.

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:43.230
What I did was I set it
up on Google Assistant.

00:18:43.230 --> 00:18:46.860
I can run it on my phone, I
