00:20:37.531 --> 00:20:40.030
So we pass in this date and we
get back an answer that looks

00:20:40.030 --> 00:20:40.675
like this.

00:20:40.675 --> 00:20:42.050
And notice that's
a regular JSON.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:44.050
That's just an array in
