00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:45.340
with three different values.

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:47.290
That's not suitable to be read.

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:50.450
So there's that specific
webhook response we have to do.

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:51.790
And we map that over in Apigee.

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:53.710
So then I have two things to do.

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:56.290
I have to take the webhook
request that came in.

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:59.080
I've got to remap that into
