00:32:05.600 --> 00:32:06.920
then there's this flow in here.

00:32:06.920 --> 00:32:11.250
And if the agent action is Find
Class Times, that's in here.

00:32:11.250 --> 00:32:13.547
So that's how I set those up.

00:32:13.547 --> 00:32:15.630
